5,1,1,talk,Servas,,We must learn from the past. I propose we examine the outcomes of the last three internal rollouts.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I am worried about the budget. I will look into the capital budget and software allowance.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Sakura,,I keep tripping over missing details! I want to check network coverage at customer plants.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,I need to see the actual friction. I will investigate time lost to copying existing records.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Asuka,,We ignore the human cost. I will look into in-house developer availability and staffing of the coordination group.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Servas,,"Daisuke, your caution is wise, but history is a better teacher than fear.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,I... I just want to make sure we don't overspend. It feels safer to check the numbers first.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Sakura,,"Ooh, Servas is being so serious! I hope I don't get lost in the data maze.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,I agree with Servas. We need to quantify the daily inefficiencies before we commit resources.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"If we don't check who is actually working, the project fails before it starts.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Servas,,"Asuka, you speak truth. The people are the engine, not the fuel.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,I am listening. I will try to be more direct about my concerns regarding the funding source.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Sakura,,I feel like a detective! I will peek at the vendor licence pricing versus fixed-fee work too.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,I will also look into misrouted deliveries in the incident logs to see the real impact.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Asuka,,I will stick to my two choices. The staffing issue is the critical bottleneck.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Servas,,Let us proceed with these investigations. May the truth guide our hands.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,Okay. I will do my best to find the answers we need.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Sakura,,Yippee! Let's see what secrets are hiding in the files.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,I will remain objective. The data will speak for itself.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Asuka,,Agreed. Let us see the facts.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
